<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2"><Document><name>Tirana Guide: 16 places – bunkers, Blloku, Krujë &amp; Durrës beyond the clichés – HiddenGem.Atlas</name><description>https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/tirana/</description><Style id="must"><IconStyle><color>ff4cd8ff</color><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style><Style id="gem"><IconStyle><color>ffd0569b</color><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style><Placemark><name>1. Bunk'Art 1</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · Bring a jumper, plan two hours and go by Bolt/taxi – the bus works for the way back. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/tirana/#o1</description><Point><coordinates>19.86121,41.35314,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>2. Bunk'Art 2</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · If two bunker museums are too many: Bunk'Art 2 is in the centre and is the easier introduction. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/tirana/#o2</description><Point><coordinates>19.81955,41.32702,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>3. House of Leaves</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Ask about the photo rules at the entrance – and plan a break in a café afterwards. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/tirana/#o3</description><Point><coordinates>19.81633,41.32647,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>5. Blloku</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Fërgesë (a dish of pepper, tomato and cheese) at a terrace restaurant costs around 800–1,000 lek with bread and beer. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/tirana/#o5</description><Point><coordinates>19.81607,41.32133,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>6. Komiteti – the bar that doubles as a communism museum</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/tirana/#o6</description><Point><coordinates>19.79938,41.30992,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>7. The Pyramid of Tirana</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Plan the climb for sunset – but wear sturdy shoes. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/tirana/#o7</description><Point><coordinates>19.82159,41.32302,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>8. Dajti Ekspres (cable car)</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · In July/August queues form in late morning – go early. It combines well with Bunk'Art 1, which is nearby. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/tirana/#o8</description><Point><coordinates>19.86116,41.35083,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>9. Skanderbeg Square, clock tower &amp; Et'hem Bey Mosque</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Come early in the morning for quiet photos – and again at sunset when the square comes alive. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/tirana/#o9</description><Point><coordinates>19.81843,41.32814,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>10. National History Museum</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Go before Bunk'Art 2 – then you understand the era you see underground afterwards much better. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/tirana/#o10</description><Point><coordinates>19.81667,41.32943,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>11. Pazari i Ri – the New Bazaar</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Come in the morning to shop and again in the evening to eat – they are two different places. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/tirana/#o11</description><Point><coordinates>19.82435,41.33025,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>12. Grand Park &amp; the artificial lake</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Plan it as a calm afternoon after a museum morning – late afternoon is the most pleasant time. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/tirana/#o12</description><Point><coordinates>19.82945,41.31149,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>13. Roman amphitheatre of Durrës</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Admission is cash only – bring lek. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/tirana/#o13</description><Point><coordinates>19.445,41.31212,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>14. The abandoned villa on the hill</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · 🆓 Free to experience · This is an abandoned building: be careful with stairs and scaffolding and do not enter dilapidated areas alone. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/tirana/#o14</description><Point><coordinates>19.44623,41.31325,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>16. Krujë – Skanderbeg castle &amp; bazaar</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Go in the morning, then you have peace and space in the bazaar – tour groups arrive at noon. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/tirana/#o16</description><Point><coordinates>19.79334,41.50704,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark></Document></kml>
